# Gradle build outputs. These are anchored to module roots on purpose: a bare
# `build/` matches at *any* depth, which silently excluded five vendored proto
# files whose upstream paths contain a `build` component — including
# build_event_stream.proto, the entire BEP schema. Prefer a pattern that lets
# a stray build directory show up noisily in `git status` over one that can
# quietly drop source files.
/build/
/*/build/
.gradle/
.kotlin/

/out/
bin/

.DS_Store
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/

hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*
